this recession, which could become a depression
or maybe already is, but is not yet reflected

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.439
in all of the numbers.

00:02:59.439 --> 00:03:02.859
Trump is often using the right tools, but
it's always done in the wrong way.

00:03:02.859 --> 00:03:08.260
It's always done in a corrupt way, eliminating
